# Force LF on checkout everywhere, including Windows CI runners
# (core.autocrlf=true on windows-latest images). The suite has
# byte- and diff-sensitive tests — codex-skills drift (diff -r against
# freshly generated LF files), the rules-skill 3.7KB injection budget,
# and the harness JSON-envelope roundtrips — that all break on a CRLF
# checkout (PR #114 windows-latest run 29781125664).
* text=auto eol=lf
